<page-meta root-font-size='system'></page-meta>
<view class='zyzt' style='background-color:rgba(255,145,41,0.1);color:rgb(255,145,41)'>当你开启以下权限时，即代表你已阅读并同意<text bindtap='fwxy' style='color:#576b95'>《软件许可及服务协议》</text>、<text bindtap='ysbhzy' style='color:#576b95'>《隐私保护指引》</text>。如果你不同意<text bindtap='fwxy' style='color:#576b95'>《软件许可及服务协议》</text>、<text bindtap='ysbhzy' style='color:#576b95'>《隐私保护指引》</text>，请关闭以下权限。</view>
<view class='weui-cells__group weui-cells__group_form' data-weui-theme='{{theme}}'>
	<view class='weui-cells__title'>接收邮件</view>
	<view class='weui-cells weui-cells_form'>
